  "valid_path": "The guard stub scans/copies the source one byte at a time. If the NUL terminator is reached before reading byte index 31, it writes the NUL into dest[length] and returns to 0x401199. The original code then calls puts(buf), producing input followed by LF on stdout, and main returns 0.",
